{"id":"c955310a21272c92","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-counter-two-universality.md","title":"两个计数器的识别能力","display":"thm-counter-two-universality — 两个计数器的识别能力","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-counter-two-universality","aliases":["73-thm-counter-two-universality"],"display":"thm-counter-two-universality — 两个计数器的识别能力","depends_on":["[[73-thm-two-stack-turing-equivalence]]","[[73-thm-two-stacks-three-counters]]","[[73-df-prime-exponent-counter-code]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§8.5.4, Theorem 8.15, print pp. 360–361; PDF pp. 382–383","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":8},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-counter-two-universality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-counter-two-universality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-counter-two-universality — 两个计数器的识别能力"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bff9c8d0e9f70335\" href=\"?note=bff9c8d0e9f70335\" title=\"73-thm-two-stack-turing-equivalence\">73-thm-two-stack-turing-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb4984fbec82c2e\" href=\"?note=5fb4984fbec82c2e\" title=\"73-thm-two-stacks-three-counters\">73-thm-two-stacks-three-counters</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e1d0bc84062e5d0c\" href=\"?note=e1d0bc84062e5d0c\" title=\"73-df-prime-exponent-counter-code\">73-df-prime-exponent-counter-code</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§8.5.4, Theorem 8.15, print pp. 360–361; PDF pp. 382–383"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"8"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；各计数器机带一个不属于输入字母表的结束字符。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathsf{RE}_\\Sigma\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists M\\;[\\operatorname{CounterMachine}_{\\Sigma,2}(M)\\land L=L_{\\mathsf{ctr}}(M)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L\\in\\mathsf{RE}_\\Sigma\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists M\\;[\\operatorname{CounterMachine}_{\\Sigma,2}(M)\\land L=L_{\\mathsf{ctr}}(M)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由三个计数器到两个：一个保存 2ⁱ3ʲ5ᵏ，另一个暂存。单位加减循环实现乘除固定素数；测试可整除性时有限控制记余数，随后恢复主计数值，不能破坏被测数据。反向 TM 可在带上直接表示两个自然数并模拟每次单位操作。这里是可计算性等价，幂编码可能导致极大时间开销，不能推出多项式时间等价。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-thm-two-stack-turing-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"bff9c8d0e9f70335","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-two-stack-turing-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-two-stacks-three-counters","status":"resolved","id":"5fb4984fbec82c2e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-two-stacks-three-counters]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-prime-exponent-counter-code","status":"resolved","id":"e1d0bc84062e5d0c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-prime-exponent-counter-code]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathsf{RE}_\\Sigma\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists M\\;[\\operatorname{CounterMachine}_{\\Sigma,2}(M)\\land L=L_{\\mathsf{ctr}}(M)].","display":true}],"bytes":1528,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-181","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-counter-two-universality|两个计数器的识别能力]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["bff9c8d0e9f70335","5fb4984fbec82c2e","e1d0bc84062e5d0c"]}